# ---------------------------------------------------------------- surfaces
# The closed surfaces: chamber 1, chamber 2, chamber 3, the bottle
ContactPropertyRegion;101;1;3
ContactPropertyRegion;102;2;3;4
ContactPropertyRegion;103;4;5
ContactPropertyRegion;104;6
# The subsurfaces: inflators of chamber 1 (201, 202), its vent (203), its
# permeable side (204), the hole in the bulkhead (205), inflators of chamber 2
# (206, 207), the hole (208) and the permeable patch (209) between chambers
# 2 and 3, the vent of chamber 3 (210)
ContactElemSurface;201;1006
ContactElemSurface;202;1011
ContactElemSurface;203;1506
ContactElemSurface;204;1201;Through;1216
ContactElemSurface;205;3006
ContactElemSurface;206;2406
